{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9c447e9bb895df81c70be5844e1976f6f1a7d252610eb8a3201bb2c4d73eb82", "ja": "（今日は、静香の初ステージだ。\n緊張してないだろうか？）", "zh": "（今天是静香首次登台表演，\n不知道她会不会紧张？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ac553c1dd7ca2933d332bfd7a5555a24026118e746687885541016707b371d7", "ja": "ここでターンしてっ……。", "zh": "这里要转圈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "6a8be319b7ab8a55a2ed44c048194cb230cf24b4f024ec27a1218e259b578f14", "ja": "っ、ダメ！\nタイミングが合ってない……！", "zh": "呃，不行！\n时机没对上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad1dfc0fb1f8b093622aaa2763ed2155ae006239a14ae09dbf63c4687a6eb908", "ja": "もうすぐ本番なのに……。\nも、もう1度、最初からやってみないと！", "zh": "明明都快正式上台了……\n我、我得从头再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "94d74f2b8aaf57bb734fb35b80e7af8b66146404f57d43f0219c2c1839ec88ea", "ja": "静香？\nどうしたんだ、汗だくじゃないか！", "zh": "静香？\n你怎么啦，满身大汗的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f4063d2bdd51bffcd7e57076268a2c27afb4c2ab6c3c36e0eb317753f817d94c", "ja": "何か飲んだか？\nそれに、タオルは……。", "zh": "你有喝水吗？\n还有毛巾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "98f153d7d43b9378e884faf9f5e338b5a8b5de8fde06c2e2fed1e6db8cc0dfeb", "ja": "大丈夫です、心配いりません。", "zh": "我没事的，不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "5317e6f4bbc2a55b1bc016fa48606b3f2da48beda91d1c64f392df9f58b4b387", "ja": "体を動かしてた方が落ち着きます。\nそれに……こんなダンスじゃ、全然ダメなんですっ。", "zh": "活动身体比较能冷静下来。\n而且……跳成这样，完全不行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0f08b076ade5f3b98eedd1fb04c1200b179eea9fb41c0657263f987bb47e6451", "ja": "（緊張が、悪い方に出てるみたいだな。\n少し落ち着かせないと……）", "zh": "（看来紧张让她无法好好发挥，\n得让她冷静下来才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "08b59b2c1c5c915e138c135b81fa021d028f94255ff563af816b5c7f3f5b891b", "ja": "タイミングもバラバラだし、\nリズムにも乗りきれなくて……。", "zh": "时机抓得很乱，\n节奏也没完全跟上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "7acff3b1c14377809baf60205dce56cab7626035487c45d59e7aabb6cbb7d705", "ja": "どうして……？　なんでっ？\n昨日までは、ちゃんとできてたのに……！", "zh": "为什么……？怎么会？\n昨天以前我明明还跳得好好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dee0237c32a168bcff5afb66b7aecfbfde3d2286419c0260b13311408d9c4daa", "ja": "静香。\nいいから、1回落ち着こう。な？", "zh": "静香。\n没事的，你先冷静一下，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "7ab77817dab75acdb2e1dd21460e686542252ab20c06c3de0d60388bf7dd0431", "ja": "私は落ち着いています！", "zh": "我很冷静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "5964cc78a8a82946c08888642f8f95684996877b94c078feacfb66a7e144e332", "ja": "絶対に、絶対に失敗できない……\n今日のステージで、結果を出さなくちゃ……。", "zh": "我绝对、绝对不能失败……\n我得在今天的表演上展现成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "375079621b52da0c9767922103ea3f0705992148ad7f4544ad7733cd6cc60349", "ja": "（静香、相当焦ってるな……\n全然周りが見えていないじゃないか）", "zh": "（静香相当焦虑呢……\n她完全看不见周遭。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8e42bfb42647cd5950fc32de00bcd5d67645d21f935082dc36064d8d30abde13", "ja": "なぁ、静香。アイドルのライブで\n一番大切なことって、なんだと思う？", "zh": "我说静香，你觉得在偶像的演唱会上，\n最重要的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "3346addcef40e8595dbe926cd020374a1bc41d4c5eb20061eb456e03ebf80acf", "ja": "そんなの、決まってるじゃないですか。\n完璧なパフォーマンスをすることです。", "zh": "那还用问。\n当然是带来完美的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ba829af305146bec42215070de2b33bc149c2619b85b4cc82c6d6d5008c63cb8", "ja": "確かに、完璧なパフォーマンスができたら最高だ。\nでも、上手に歌って踊ることが目的じゃないよな？", "zh": "确实，如果能带来完美的表演自然是最好的。\n但唱得好跳得好并非主要目的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8cb9a6eb8271a37604d8eb5b4c979730b3b7e7a23061c8ed6322a36c07228b76", "ja": "毎日レッスンして、ダンスをしっかり覚えて。\n完璧なパフォーマンスをするのは、誰のためだ？", "zh": "每天训练、认真记舞步，\n你是为了谁而献上完美的表演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "70592df381531de0abb3875c55f0925104aaa700d31d01df1ffdfba82145f0c3", "ja": "それは…………っ。", "zh": "这…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "7bc1edf2c64274a3a5cdf879aab233d7d66527284df772506794cf902aff1b5b", "ja": "それは……お客さんのため……。\n応援してくれる、ファンのみんなのため、です……。", "zh": "这是……为了观众……\n为了支持我的粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fbf8976ad1c803575cb12b9b83b8b7da89b664bd35e63f2894ab29029808de11", "ja": "そういうこと！　一番大事なことは、\n来てくれたお客さん達を楽しませることだ。", "zh": "没错！最重要的，\n就是要让来看的观众们开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "010450caeb01151cced76bd86b7ce558637f5e60d2a0de05246c292862dd6913", "ja": "静香なら、できるよな？", "zh": "静香办得到吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ac79e00fc4ef79980779d18c53d2b934b3ce6c8f3111ab810893a5fe248ed120", "ja": "よし！　それじゃあ胸を張って行ってこい。\nお客さんが、静香を待ってるぞ！", "zh": "好！那就抬头挺胸地上场吧。\n观众们都在等静香喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "1b434e1b7763c78cbc00a19ce3df938b2086f40aa2a1575898ca1c3e73c472b0", "ja": "……。\nあ……あのっ！", "zh": "……\n那……那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c66ad7dc9005d6f0e73d98c34ace0c952c609449b08943e6196f6d4e39b5d86d", "ja": "ん、どうした？\nまだ、不安なことでもあるのか？", "zh": "嗯，怎么啦？\n还有哪里不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "d79c5c4d48241625d62307a836f5f8f5ffee6ee2a63b702806b4e3ed374e57fd", "ja": "い、いえ、そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不是的，不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "cec3f33f9c5fc65518de36082d3d2734db3395781c1870e5039cf27b5ed0d3ef", "ja": "{$P$}。\nア、アドバイス……ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n谢、谢谢你……给我建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "f1b69703404b4a5b0aad62b9c28aec784a5dd1d6f9bbfd5b603f8cdd09e38ce4", "ja": "っ……そ、それだけです！\nいってきます！", "zh": "……就、就这样！\n我走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cbe0bc8e0f6796796d8c9c1ea024c3a0767997b42fbfceff4a78400553a92a28", "ja": "……静香！\n裏で、観てるからな！", "zh": "……静香！\n我会在后台看着你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_015siz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "26f170c4855178cd54f945c7ec6ff209a0b0c05000748a8c48974af2a203cb18", "ja": "（少し照れくさそうな顔を隠すように、\n静香は身を翻し、舞台へと駆けていった）", "zh": "（似乎是想掩饰自己略为害羞的表情，\n静香转身跑上了舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
